an class=\\"rollup-item-target\\">→ Grouped in Dock Positions</span>\\n                  </div>\\n                \\n                  <div class=\\"rollup-summary-item\\">\\n                    <span class=\\"rollup-item-name\\"><strong>Dock Lights</strong> ($5,440.00)</span>\\n                    <span class=\\"rollup-item-target\\">→ Grouped in Dock Positions</span>\\n                  </div>\\n                \\n                  <div class=\\"rollup-summary-item\\">\\n                    <span class=\\"rollup-item-name\\"><strong>Quad Receptacles @ Dock Doors</strong> ($4,500.00)</span>\\n                    <span class=\\"rollup-item-target\\">→ Grouped in Dock Positions</span>\\n                  </div>\\n                \\n                  <div class=\\"rollup-summary-item\\">\\n                    <span class=\\"rollup-item-name\\"><strong>Demising Wall</strong> ($238,810.00)</span>\\n                    <span class=\\"rollup-item-target\\">→ Grouped in Demising Wall Assembly</span>\\n                  </div>\\n                \\n                  <div class=\\"rollup-summary-item\\">\\n                    <span class=\\"rollup-item-name\\"><strong>Paint Demising Wall (1 Side)</strong> ($18,236.40)</span>\\n                    <span class=\\"rollup-item-target\\">→ Grouped in Demising Wall Assembly</span>\\n                  </div>\\n                \\n        </div>\\n    </div>\\n    \\n\\n    \\n      <div class=\\"rollup-summary-section\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 8px 0;\\">Tenant Share Summary</h3>\\n          <p class=\\"rollup-summary-description\\">The following items have been prorated based on tenant responsibility percentage:</p>\\n          <div class=\\"tenant-share-content\\">\\n              \\n                  <div class=\\"tenant-share-item\\">\\n                    <div class=\\"tenant-share-header\\">\\n                      <span class=\\"tenant-share-name\\"><strong>Demising Wall</strong></span>\\n                      <span class=\\"tenant-share-percentage\\">50% Tenant Share</span>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <div class=\\"tenant-share-breakdown\\">\\n                      <div class=\\"cost-item\\">\\n                        <span class=\\"cost-label\\">Total Cost</span>\\n                        <span class=\\"cost-value\\">$238,810.00</span>\\n                      </div>\\n                      <div class=\\"cost-item\\">\\n                        <span class=\\"cost-label\\">Tenant Share</span>\\n                        <span class=\\"cost-value tenant-cost\\">$119,405.00</span>\\n                      </div>\\n                      <div class=\\"cost-item\\">\\n                        <span class=\\"cost-label\\">Outstanding Share</span>\\n                        <span class=\\"cost-value remaining-cost\\">$119,405.00</span>\\n                      </div>\\n                    </div>\\n                  </div>\\n                \\n              <div class=\\"tenant-share-note\\">\\n                <strong>Note:</strong> The \\"Remaining\\" amounts represent costs that could be attributed to other tenants \\n                or additional lease allocations to achieve 100% cost recovery for shared improvements.\\n              </div>\\n          </div>\\n      </div>\\n      \\n\\n    \\n      <div class=\\"section\\">\\n          <div class=\\"section-header\\">\\n              <h2 class=\\"section-title\\">\\n                  Existing Improvements\\n                  <span style=\\"color: #28a745; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px;\\">$240,457.74 <span style=\\"font-size: 50%; font-weight: normal;\\">($1.95/RSF)</span></span>\\n              </h2>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\"table-container\\">\\n              <table>\\n                  <thead>\\n                      <tr>\\n                          <th>Description</th>\\n                          <th>Quantity</th>\\n                  