ments</span>\\n              </div><div class=\\"rollup-summary-item\\">\\n                <span class=\\"rollup-item-name\\"><strong>Materials Testing</strong> ($12,500.00)</span>\\n                <span class=\\"rollup-item-target\\">→ Rolling to Tenant Improvements</span>\\n              </div><div class=\\"rollup-summary-item\\">\\n                <span class=\\"rollup-item-name\\"><strong>Permit Expediter</strong> ($7,500.00)</span>\\n                <span class=\\"rollup-item-target\\">→ Rolling to Tenant Improvements</span>\\n              </div><div class=\\"rollup-summary-item\\">\\n                <span class=\\"rollup-item-name\\"><strong>Construction Management Fee (3%)</strong> ($165,194.10)</span>\\n                <span class=\\"rollup-item-target\\">→ Rolling to Tenant Improvements</span>\\n              </div>\\n        </div>\\n    </div>\\n    \\n\\n    \\n    <div class=\\"rollup-summary-section\\">\\n        <h3 style=\\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 8px 0;\\">Assembly Summary</h3>\\n        <p class=\\"rollup-summary-description\\">The following line items are grouped into assemblies:</p>\\n        <div class=\\"rollup-summary-content\\">\\n            \\n                  <div class=\\"rollup-summary-item\\">\\n                    <span class=\\"rollup-item-name\\"><strong>Electrical Service Distribution</strong> ($88,385.00)</span>\\n                    <span class=\\"rollup-item-target\\">→ Grouped in Electrical Service Assembly</span>\\n                  </div>\\n                \\n                  <div class=\\"rollup-summary-item\\">\\n                    <span class=\\"rollup-item-name\\"><strong>Electrical Feeder Run (For 3 Main Panels @ 120 lf.)</strong> ($144,360.00)</span>\\n                    <span class=\\"rollup-item-target\\">→ Grouped in Electrical Service Assembly</span>\\n                  </div>\\n                \\n        </div>\\n    </div>\\n    \\n\\n    \\n\\n    \\n      <div class=\\"se