-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 8px 0;\\">Line Item Rollup Summary <span style=\\"color: #9333ea; font-style: italic; font-weight: normal;\\">($741,944.84)</span></h3>\\n        <p class=\\"rollup-summary-description\\">The following items are being redistributed to different categories:</p>\\n        <div class=\\"rollup-summary-content\\">\\n            <div class=\\"rollup-summary-item\\">\\n                <span class=\\"rollup-item-name\\"><strong>Design (Architectural)</strong> ($95,000.00)</span>\\n                <span class=\\"rollup-item-target\\">→ Rolling to Tenant Improvements</span>\\n              </div><div class=\\"rollup-summary-item\\">\\n                <span class=\\"rollup-item-name\\"><strong>Builder's Risk Insurance</strong> ($37,500.00)</span>\\n                <span class=\\"rollup-item-target\\">→ Rolling to Tenant Improvements</span>\\n              </div><div class=\\"rollup-summary-item\\">\\n                <span class=\\"rollup-item-name\\"><strong>Permit Expediter</strong> ($7,500.00)</span>\\n                <span class=\\"rollup-item-target\\">→ Rolling to Tenant Improvements</span>\\n              </div><div class=\\"rollup-summary-item\\">\\n                <span class=\\"rollup-item-name\\"><strong>Certificate of Occupancy</strong> ($2,500.00)</span>\\n                <span class=\\"rollup-item-target\\">→ Rolling to Tenant Improvements</span>\\n              </div><div class=\\"rollup-summary-item\\">\\n                <span class=\\"rollup-item-name\\"><strong>Permit Fees (3.5%)</strong> ($175,031.19)</span>\\n                <span class=\\"rollup-item-target\\">→ Rolling to Tenant Improvements</span>\\n              </div><div class=\\"rollup-summary-item\\">\\n                <span class=\\"rollup-item-name\\"><strong>Materials Testing</strong> ($12,500.00)</span>\\n                <span class=\\"rollup-item-target\\">→ Rolling to Tenant Improvements</span>\\n              </div><div class=\\"rollup-summary-item\\